  {
   "id": "crisol-theater-of-idols-265827@major-2026-02-18",
   "gameId": "crisol-theater-of-idols-265827",
   "displayName": "Update on Performance, Bugs, DLSS, Ultrawide, and more",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-18T19:11:46.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone, we wanted to provide a quick update on what the team at Vermila is working on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've been closely reading all of the comments across social media, Reddit, Discord, and of course right here on Steam. Some of the major things we've noted:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug fixes (of course)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Overall performance improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "DLSS requests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Ultrawide requests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Good news, all of these things are being worked on! Over the coming weeks we'll be rolling out a series of patches. In the first one, this is a snapshot of what's to come:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/google-medium/1f5a5-fe0f@2x.png\"] PC – Patch Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with custom graphics configuration that prevented changes from being applied.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the Resume button did not load the latest save game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with Coins achievement tracking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes related to save file issues (although we still highly recommend deleting any prior demo files, as those are causing issues).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "And many more!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And for PS5 players (you may own the game on PS5 as well, or have friends that do, so please pass these notes along!):",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/google-medium/1f3ae@2x.png\"] PlayStation – Patch Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with custom graphics configuration that prevented changes from being applied.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the Resume button did not load the latest save game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with Coins achievement tracking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a loading issue affecting the Liquid Puzzle on PS5.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And many more!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "DLSS is actively being worked on, but requires coordination with NVidia and therefore cannot be solely handled by the developers, so stay tuned there. Ultrawide monitor support is also being worked on, but in the meantime we see that the community already has a suggested fix. Thank you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, we've seen that some of you brilliant folks are working on mods for the game. We LOVE THIS. We fully encourage modding of the game, and would love to highlight them as they come out. Just make sure to join the Blumhouse Games Discord and keep us updated as those go live.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More updates to come soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
